# #5866 G4 (a5e2e2ef, #5866 comments 6667971108 and 6668685415): only the donor's bound ends at
# L's link witness; the close L carries after its link - the key-moving close's deferred head,
# with its staleHigh - lasts until L's arm resolves it at the partition.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestWitnessEndsDeferredHead
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the link witness also ends the carried key-moving close before L's arm resolves it, so a stale donor's write admitted under the old generation after the link, before L re-claims, is in no bound L reads and L free-advances past it
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithLatch = TRUE, WithOtherLinkRaise = TRUE

--- FIND
CloseCarried == BoundPending \/ (pend /\ moved)
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the witness ends the carried close before the arm.
CloseCarried == BoundPending \/ (pend /\ moved /\ ~lw)
--- END